{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897100/extras/d5512a1d922da8c32b0a7b287e69cdc6.avif?t=1760456099\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SNIPERBOT: THE HYPE GAME</strong> is a retro-inspired action platformer that plunges players into the neon-soaked, Hip-Hop cybertech realm of Meta Metro. In a city overrun by Hypebeasts, and clout is currency, survival demands mastery of your weapons, endurance through relentless enemy swarms, and victory in epic boss battles. Keep your eye on the target and Snipe the Hype! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897100/extras/51150261a332520bd5b9bd2fc815ec60.avif?t=1760456099\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blaster and Blade Combat</strong><br>Swap seamlessly between ranged and melee attacks to handle threats with speed, precision, and style.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Beast Modes (Skill-Swap System)</strong><br>Defeat Hypebeast Generals to earn <strong>unique super abilities</strong> called <i>Beast Modes</i>, which you can equip and swap mid-mission to suit your playstyle.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo-Ready Combat Feel</strong><i></i><br>A responsive combat system lets you fluidly link attacks and abilities into satisfying chains, creating a fast, expressive flow that rewards both precision and style.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focused, Replayable Campaign</strong><br>A handcrafted, high-impact adventure packed with build variety, secret paths, and stylish encounters, delivering pure gameplay with no filler.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over-the-Top Boss Battles</strong><br>Go head-to-head with viral Hypebeast icons, each with their own arena, patterns, and cinematic flair.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fresh Aesthetic Identity</strong><br>The game combines the fun of retro action platforming gameplay with the aesthetics of sneaker and Hypebeast culture, brought to life with bold 3D visuals and late \u201880s / early \u201890s Hip-Hop energy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897100/extras/f530d8b637052bd8712e6f5d53a9e0d3.avif?t=1760456099\" width=616 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897100/extras/e5c618c7e9d4498cee4ca6fdd658c3b8.poster.avif?t=1760456099\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897100/extras/e5c618c7e9d4498cee4ca6fdd658c3b8.webm?t=1760456099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897100/extras/e5c618c7e9d4498cee4ca6fdd658c3b8.mp4?t=1760456099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight Platforming Inspired by Genre Greats</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate intricate levels designed for fast, responsive controls, featuring smooth wall-jumps, chainable dashes, vertical challenges, and hidden routes that reward skill and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897100/extras/3701c00b9a7e5e376b2aa02cd1179b82.avif?t=1760456099\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897100/extras/549f06dc7bd7ec27773ecfb47bb8c7dd.avif?t=1760456099\" width=616 height=490 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897100?t=1760456099","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897100/5f27287fc3ddb0f0b639718f83733bca187720f0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760456099","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897100/97f75afcd2a822b1da5245f6905b1ca2afbcab27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760456099","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897100/97f75afcd2a822b1da5245f6905b1ca2afbcab27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760456099","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3968960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897100/extras/d5512a1d922da8c32b0a7b287e69cdc6.avif?t=1760456099\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SNIPERBOT: THE HYPE GAME</strong> is a retro-inspired action platformer that plunges players into the neon-soaked, Hip-Hop cybertech realm of Meta Metro. In a city overrun by Hypebeasts, and clout is currency, survival demands mastery of your weapons, endurance through relentless enemy swarms, and victory in epic boss battles. Keep your eye on the target and Snipe the Hype! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897100/extras/51150261a332520bd5b9bd2fc815ec60.avif?t=1760456099\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blaster and Blade Combat</str